      "en": "scene chinamispringnoongen",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/chinamispringnoongen.webp",
      "alt": "chinamispringnoongen"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Papa?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 爸爸？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Stop calling me that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 别这么叫我。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can Chinami ask you a question?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": Chinami 能问你个问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Go for it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 行。问吧。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you think is behind the wall?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 你觉得墙后面是什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm not really sure.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我真不太清楚。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I try not to think about it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我尽量不去想。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you think it's scary? Like...a monster?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 你觉得吓人吗？像……怪物？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it's possible. But don't tell your sister I said that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 我觉得有可能。不过别跟你姐说是我说的。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will Papa get in trouble for revealing the secrets of the universe to Chinami?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 爸爸会因为向 Chinami 泄露宇宙的秘密而惹麻烦吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's not a secret if it's something I'm guessing. I just don't want Chika to think I'm scaring you for no reason.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 如果只是我猜的东西，那就不算秘密。我只是不想让 Chika 觉得我在无缘无故吓你。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami has other things she's afraid of before monsters. And those things are all {i}inside{/i} the wall.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 在怪物之前，Chinami 还有别的害怕的东西。而那些东西全在墙{i}里面{/i}。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": ……"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can Chinami ask you another question?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": Chinami 能再问一个问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 行……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you think is {i}behind{/i} behind the wall?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 你觉得「{i}后面{/i}的后面」是什么？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 你是说——"
    },
    {
      "en": ": The furthest place you can think of. Somewhere none of us will reach until we're ready to leave Kumon-mi behind.",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 你能想到的最远的地方。我们所有人要等到准备好离开 Kumon-mi 之后才会到的地方。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": ……"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe a monster.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 也许是个怪物。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe something worse.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 也许是更糟的东西。"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Worse than a monster?",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ": 比怪物还糟？"
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe it's nothing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ": 也许什么都没有。"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ chinami_love += 1",
